{
  "id": "莫邪",
  "name": "莫邪",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "object",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "soushenji-11-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "楚干将莫邪为楚王作剑，三年乃成，王怒，欲"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-10-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "则险，心有目则眩。兵莫憯于志而莫邪为下；寇莫大于阴阳而抱鼓为小，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-12-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "则生争斗。故曰：兵莫憯于意志，莫邪为下；寇莫大于阴阳，枹鼓为小。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "也，此皆相似者。故剑工惑剑之似莫邪者，唯欧冶能名其种；玉工眩玉之"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 22,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-22-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "一捣，则折胁伤干，为此弃干将、莫邪而以手战，则悖矣。所谓言者，齐"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "soushenji",
    "chapterIndex": 11
  }
}
